          <td data-label="Alternative"><strong>Stay in the current field</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why it can beat it">Stability</td>
          <td data-label="Catch">Slower change</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Alternative"><strong>Move with a bridge project</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why it can beat it">Evidence</td>
          <td data-label="Catch">Needs effort</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Alternative"><strong>Own service route</strong></td>
